	(text "Pack sense: VBAT_SENSE = VIN x 39k / (100k + 39k).  Full pack 8.4 V (VIN about 8.35 V after Q1) -> 2.34 V at GPIO34, inside the ESP32 ADC's 2.45 V range (11 dB)."
